Algorithm: Split the input path by '/' to get segments. Iterate through each segment and process it:    - If the segment is '.' or empty, skip it.    - If the segment is '..', pop from the stack if it is not empty (to handle parent directory).    - Otherwise, push the segment to the stack. Join the stack elements with '/' and prepend a '/' to form the canonical path. If the stack is empty, return '/' (root directory).

